+
+## 2. Independent reproduction (my own check, not a reporter relay)
+
+I re-ran the engine's deterministic admission test directly against canonical
+`government/knowledge-budget-tool.py` and `government/knowledge-budget.conf` on
+an isolated aggregate (no live state changed):
+
+```
+admit(0)        -> {"admit": true, "reason": "within caps"}
+admit(399000)   -> {"admit": true, "reason": "within caps"}
+admit(1200000)  -> {"admit": true, "reason": "within caps"}
