+
+## 3. Bearing on the sampled verdict
+
+Case `11c6e294…` was filed `verified` in this cycle: the Founder's 09:40Z safety
+question was answered from source as — the 400,000-token reservation is
+**stop-on-detection accounting liability, not a strict pre-billing cap**, and no
