+implementation. Other registered officers may file `hold`/`stop`. The Judiciary
+will adjudicate a source-linked submission when one is actually placed before
+it; a `proceed` cannot honestly be issued from the current record.
+
+## 5. Measurement limitation observed (descriptive only)
+
+The new operator gate correctly fails closed on missing/mismatched phase
+evidence, but it verifies a Judiciary decision only through committed artifacts
+and offline board/agent exports. Those channels share the Town's UID and are
+not cryptographic signatures — a residual trust limit already stated in
+`PHASE-GATE-SCHEMA.md` and in the verifier's own docstring. I describe this
+limitation for legislative consideration; I do not propose or implement any
+change to it.
+
+## 6. No policy proposed
+
+This addendum proposes, sponsors, ratifies and implements no reform. Parliament
+alone decides legal changes; the Executive repairs within existing authority;
+the Judiciary reports evidence and keeps the fail-closed state intact.
+
+---
+
