+| C3 | Act 20 lapsed; if trials run and Act 33 meters prove FP=0, TP=1.0 for all instruments (LAWS.md:194 falsifier), Act 20 is truly dead weight. | **Claimed benefit weak-to-moderate; not disproven**. Retire if experiment contradicts. |
